{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18d3_level_act18d3_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act18d3",
  "stageId": "act18d3_03",
  "title": "外来者",
  "storyCode": "SV-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4d9680afc68fe23ede9049e77e452654fa9dc26a41fa7673dd785b8d9db8f779",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "看看你，依然在彷徨，仿佛一只迷途的海鱼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "（看他一眼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "你想知道我带她去了哪里。你非常在意。我们的集会，你没有资格参与，可你的眼神告诉我，你想知道我们将对她做什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "你是找回你们之间的手足之爱了么？你的内心是否在因为你的故交的遭遇而经受撕扯？感到不公？从而愤怒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "你在试图找寻你看不见的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "当然，你当然可以这么回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "你以为我想伤害她。你错了，我是想帮她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "只有弄清楚她的——你们的痛苦根源来自哪里，我才能更好地帮助你们切除症结，不是么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "就像你。你主动加入我们，你想溶进真正的海洋。等你完成这个任务，你肮脏的本质将得到净化。这是海对你的恩赐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "而同样的恩赐，最后也会给予你的故交们，只要她们能同你一样，放下过去为敌时的狭见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "使你们团聚，这是第一步。理解你们，这是第二步。而到最后，你们也会理解我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "如果你能适当地减少一些废话，我们共事起来还能更融洽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "我也可以说一些会使你高兴的。你的故交——清醒的那个，她已经到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "斯卡蒂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "她不在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "自然不在。没有我的邀请，没人能进入这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "她进城了，你知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "你表现出了意外，这很有趣。这座城市里的声音，我都听见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "祂赞赏我做的一切，赐予了我力量，令我的生命进一步延展。我的感知，我的心灵，都不再受缚于你所见到的躯壳里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "我在靠近完美。我将收下你的嫉恨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "说回你的故交——她来得比预期的还快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "“深海猎人血脉相连”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "她并不知道什么在等着她。只因为你带走了另一个，她就追到了这里，一刻都不曾休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "真是令人惊叹的情谊。她知道你如今的样子么？面对叛徒，她会怎么做？是还信任你们的血脉联系、同僚旧情，还是一剑刺入你的身体？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "我很期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "（转身就走）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "你不需要急着去找她。你做得很好。你将这一个带回到她该待的地方，又将另一个引入了城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "他会满意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "你不需要知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "现在我们只等待。等到那个时候到来，你自然可以找你的故交，去传达我们的邀请。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "她未必会来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "她会来的。她会自己来找我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "又回来啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "我们住的地方是北边最好的房子，你看，这扇门还能关上。一扇能关上的门，在下雨天能帮你不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "附近有人，两个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "他们呀，他们平时就在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "一百三十、一百三十一、一百三十二......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "嗨，砖头，今天过得好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "一，二，三......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "抱歉啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "可怜的家伙，他又得重新来。他总坐在这里，数街上有几块砖。悄悄告诉你，每天数出来的结果都不大一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "还有，那是石柱，他喜欢绕着街上的柱子散步。阴雨天就不出来啦，他年纪不小了，沾了水腿会疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "你不用管他们，他们也不会管你，就像他们也不管我一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "进来吧，歌手。正式介绍一下，里面就是我家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "嗨，铁皮。嗨，墙灰。你们醒啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "（摸箱子）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "痛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "喂，木框。你又把这个外面的人带到家里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "她不是坏人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "她是外面来的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "长凳都挺喜欢她的，对不对啊，小长凳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呜......嗷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "别、别咬！歌手的裙子都要被咬坏啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "......倒还不会坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "沾满了口水，就没这么漂亮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗷，嗷嗷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "这孩子真的很喜欢你，歌手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "你们瞧，长凳也想让她留下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "你在盘算的事。别以为，我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "不会有，好结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "没有呀，我什么打算都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "怎么说，随你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "规则，不许打破。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "无论是你，还是她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "我会看着的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "我们走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "呼......总算走啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "歌手，你不用怕。铁皮就是这样的人。他看着很凶，但也不会真的对我做什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "好吧，我知道你不怕，你比他们厉害得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "我就是想说，真要动手的话，哼，我也不会怕他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "你在叹气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "这个桶空啦。盘子也是空的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "让我想想......或许床底下还有一些吃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "这里，床？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "是啊，看起来很奇怪吗？你家里的床不是铁做的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "我不大在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "有些房子里也能找到木头床。木头可有用哩。木头可以烧，让屋子变得又亮堂又暖和。有的时候你要是生病了，这里的冬天可不好过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "哎嘿——瞧瞧，这是我的宝贝盒子。早上起来的时候塞得深了些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "你可以帮我一把，把这些干了的海草从我眼前拿开。不，别扔在地上，就算不能吃了，它们也还能垫床铺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "好多东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "是啊，我把有用的都藏在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "看看这个，这是我正在缝的衣服。最近磨好的贝壳针，比过去几年的都要好使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "料子不大够用，还得去城南好好翻翻，或许还有些埋更深的没被拿走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "马上天就要变冷了，我得加快些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "不，不行，长凳，你不能动这个衣服！这是要给佩特拉奶奶的，她咳嗽越来越厉害了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "这也不行！给我松手啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "木框。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "说了多少次，不是木框，是画框啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "还有，这个也不能吃，就算给你也没用呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "木框......画框？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "你听到他们这么叫我了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "我只知道你叫安妮塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "安妮塔是我自己起的......我从佩特拉奶奶的故事里听来的，那个女孩儿和你一样，很会唱歌。是不是比木框好听多了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "我们这里的人，大多没有名字。什么顺嘴喊什么。砖头总在数砖块，铁皮家外面围着铁皮栅栏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "他们叫我木框。因为佩特拉奶奶是从这块画框下面找到我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "你说过自己的母亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "她没把我交给其他人，她够勇敢了。在我出生的时候，我们这里没有孩子，孩子活不下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "那年头没人敢惹佩特拉奶奶......她把吃的分给我。你别看她现在身体不好，她是这城里顶顶厉害的人哩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "就连铁皮都怕她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "现在好多啦。那个教士教会了我们如何活下去。你看长凳，还有那边几个孩子。我想我们这里也能渐渐变得热闹起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊啊......啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "只要别乱拿我的东西，你就还是个好孩子，是不是啊，小长凳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "别的被拿走了都没关系。晚上睡觉的时候，我把这盒子藏好。他们不知道怎么找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "唉，我们这里不分什么你的我的。我明白藏东西不好。歌手，你不会说出去的对不对？你对我的东西也不感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "你放心我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "你是客人，佩特拉奶奶教过我，我们要好好招待客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "有了，我就记得有。看吧，这儿还剩下一条鳞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "这气味......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "是半个月前的，还挺新鲜哩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "掰一下，这一半......给长凳。嘿，长凳，这里还有吃的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊......啊啊......（吞咽）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "好了，这一半给你，你吃完把骨头剩下，我还能煮上一锅汤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "食物，我去找就可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "可是还没到日子呀！你现在出门，不可能找到食物的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "总要试试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "text": "说着说着就没影了，真是个怪人啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "......还跟着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "海边。她到海边去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "对，铁皮，你想的真对。她要下海。她准备到海里去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "时候，还不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "教士说过的。要潮汐涨落一百次，我们下海，才被允许。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "铁皮，我们不能来。海边，不许来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "......这没有意义。我们，阻止她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "阻止她？难道我们打得过她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "教士说，我们要等一百次，才能去。现在，只有九十九次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "她什么都得不到。今天的海边，什么都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "那她在找什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "铁皮，这里好冷，我好饿，我们不能来，你也不要问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "海里有什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "就算知道，又能怎样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "......我不知道。铁皮，你说的，我都不知道。我不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "过去，我们最远走到过哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "最西边的西边。好久了。那时候，我们个子，只有这么高。城里，吃的还能捡到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "边界线。这个词，不常用。我们看到了，这座城市的，边缘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "那是你，铁皮，不是我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "我那时候，饿晕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "你说，要再走一段路。你要，推推运气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "......是碰碰运气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "啧，你总是，话都说不明白。教士教了你那么多年。你都学不会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "嘿嘿，铁皮，有你。你能明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "那时候，你也这么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "你一直信我。你让我拿了你的那份罐头。我又走了一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "然后你回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "是的，我回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "回来以后，你好几天没吃东西。我以为，你想饿死自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "我是想过。可饿死自己，又有什么意义？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "反正过不了多久，大家都会死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "你吓到我了。你那时候就这么说。我不知道你在说什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "后来......教士来了。他来了，我才感到了变化。我们都有了变化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "教士，好的生活。他说我们能有。他说的是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "是真的。因为......这是真理。他给我们看见的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "因为教士，我活了下来。我们都活了下来。这样，很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "那条线，没有人能跨过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "这条，海水的线吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "所有的线。就像木框做的陷阱。外面来的，都拦住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "我们也不要出去。这就是最好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "铁皮......你的脚，快要沾到水！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "水......是的。我不要过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "就算跨过去了......跨过去了，那里可能也什么都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "呼......铁皮，你总算停下了脚步。你刚刚吓坏我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "你别像那样，问这么多问题。你一直问，跟木框差不多。她从来都是怪人，教士也说她不对，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "提问......帮不了我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "只有答案才有意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "你好厉害，铁皮。教士说的话，就你记得最牢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "看，她一直在海边走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "铁皮，你要去哪里？你也要跟着去？不，这不对，我们本来就，不能跟着她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "我们打不过她，连我都知道，我们没法赶走她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "她回不来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "那......那倒是很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "我想要她那个大箱子，里面肯定有很多吃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "箱子不在。她带走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "只有这个......这个，她放在了石头上。我不知道这是什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "她一直拿着，应该是好东西吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "我能不能......能不能咬一口，铁皮？我真的好饿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "（叮咚）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "这、这是什么？我从来没听过这种声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "（叮咚，叮咚）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "快停下来吧，铁皮，这声音让我的胸口和牙齿抖个不停。你爱拿着它就拿着，我还是回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "没有意义。这个也没有意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "这种没用的东西。就该扔在地上。烂掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "一路跟着的，我以为是别人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "你，你回来了！这怎么可能？这个时候，到海边的，没有人能回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "你想去海里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "我只在这附近走走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "海里有什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "什么都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "这不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "你也变得越来越古怪了，铁皮。你还在问这些我不懂的问题，我们不是来阻止她的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "现在她往回走。我们可以回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "你都看见了。你知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "铁皮，你在发抖。你是不是生病了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "别过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "过来又怎样？像刚才一样，你把我们都打趴下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "海里有东西，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "不要动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "啊啊啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "墙灰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "这石头......她的动作，真快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "这是我的嘴发出来的声音吗？铁皮，我叫出了声。我的心脏怦怦跳。我是不是也生病了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "我以为，你的脑袋会砰一下炸开。就跟被砸烂的贝壳一样，露出里面白花花的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "那样我会死吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "下回试试就知道了。现在烂掉的是别的东西。我没见过这种。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "text": "它怎么......还会动？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "逃吧，回城去。动作要快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "text": "——记得把我的琴留下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
